(7340465, 1147018, 180170, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love it, this is my favourite one of the challenge.10 from me :)</td>', 'Absolutely love it, this is my favourite one of the challenge.10 from me :)', '2015-04-10 02:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340466, 1147118, 180170, '<td valign="top">very,very nice. 10 from me, my second favourite :)</td>', 'very,very nice. 10 from me, my second favourite :)', '2015-04-10 02:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340467, 1146959, 180170, '<td valign="top">I think this is wonderful, nice and contrasty. Love the fact the door is open, that makes it. This is my 3rd favourite :)</td>', 'I think this is wonderful, nice and contrasty. Love the fact the door is open, that makes it. This is my 3rd favourite :)', '2015-04-10 02:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340576, 1146399, 16046, '<td valign="top">Best in show award, congrats</td>', 'Best in show award, congrats', '2015-04-10 11:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340577, 1147070, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 2</td>', 'Top 2', '2015-04-10 11:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340578, 1146784, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 3</td>', 'Top 3', '2015-04-10 11:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340580, 1147111, 16046, '<td valign="top">Front page stuff</td>', 'Front page stuff', '2015-04-10 11:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340587, 1147130, 177322, '<td valign="top">Subtle but effective "line."  The processing nicely accents the tank. Nine from me.</td>', 'Subtle but effective "line."  The processing nicely accents the tank. Nine from me.', '2015-04-10 11:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340588, 1147051, 177322, '<td valign="top">For my personal taste, there is just a tad too much flare, but, most certainly, the leading lines are strong and effective.  Seven from me.</td>', 'For my personal taste, there is just a tad too much flare, but, most certainly, the leading lines are strong and effective.  Seven from me.', '2015-04-10 12:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340589, 1147070, 177322, '<td valign="top">Looks like a neon snake.  Six from me.</td>', 'Looks like a neon snake.  Six from me.', '2015-04-10 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340590, 1147033, 177322, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this would have looked with a portrait orientation - where more of the leaf could have built a longer, stronger line?  Still, there is a nice terminal point and the added interest of the snail.  Five from me.</td>', 'I wonder how this would have looked with a portrait orientation - where more of the leaf could have built a longer, stronger line?  Still, there is a nice terminal point and the added interest of the snail.  Five from me.', '2015-04-10 12:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340594, 1146798, 177322, '<td valign="top">What a touching critter-to-human interaction.  It is a sweet shot, but, forgive me, personally I have the impression that the "line" is a huge distraction.   Perhaps if the fence had been captured as coming from either lower corner it would have been more effective?  Because of the heaviness and centeredness of the fence line, I can award this no more than a four.  I hope in the future you are able to capture the interaction of these two again because there appears to be some genuine whispering going on there.</td>', 'What a touching critter-to-human interaction.  It is a sweet shot, but, forgive me, personally I have the impression that the "line" is a huge distraction.   Perhaps if the fence had been captured as coming from either lower corner it would have been more effective?  Because of the heaviness and centeredness of the fence line, I can award this no more than a four.  I hope in the future you are able to capture the interaction of these two again because there appears to be some genuine whispering going on there.', '2015-04-10 12:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340596, 1146784, 177322, '<td valign="top">When I opened this my eyes popped and my brain shouted, "Wow!"  Ten from me.</td>', 'When I opened this my eyes popped and my brain shouted, "Wow!"  Ten from me.', '2015-04-10 12:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340599, 1147053, 177322, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen.  Five.</td>', 'Nicely seen.  Five.', '2015-04-10 12:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340601, 1146399, 177322, '<td valign="top">From all the thumbnails this one stood out the most for me.  The bricks create subtle, but multiple, lines to infinity and encourage the viewer to move through the picture; alas, there stands an interdicting obstruction - a challenger to the viewer''s voyage.  Perhaps that white vertical line under the model''s left ear could have been burned to be less harsh?  Still, a solid ten from me.</td>', 'From all the thumbnails this one stood out the most for me.  The bricks create subtle, but multiple, lines to infinity and encourage the viewer to move through the picture; alas, there stands an interdicting obstruction - a challenger to the viewer''s voyage.  Perhaps that white vertical line under the model''s left ear could have been burned to be less harsh?  Still, a solid ten from me.', '2015-04-10 12:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340602, 1147024, 177322, '<td valign="top">Well seen and playful.  Six.</td>', 'Well seen and playful.  Six.', '2015-04-10 12:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340604, 1147111, 177322, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective with the diagonal line across the frame.  Six.</td>', 'Simple and effective with the diagonal line across the frame.  Six.', '2015-04-10 12:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340607, 1147060, 177322, '<td valign="top">So darn cute!! Maybe there is not strong leading line, but I do like the way twig from the left of the frame points to the petal-eating mouse. Cuteness/framing/sharpness earn an eight from me.</td>', 'So darn cute!! Maybe there is not strong leading line, but I do like the way twig from the left of the frame points to the petal-eating mouse. Cuteness/framing/sharpness earn an eight from me.', '2015-04-10 12:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340612, 1147063, 177322, '<td valign="top">While I''m not sure about any leading lines, I can''t resist the cuteness: five.</td>', 'While I''m not sure about any leading lines, I can''t resist the cuteness: five.', '2015-04-10 12:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340624, 1146641, 159510, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike></td>', '', '2015-04-10 13:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340625, 1147122, 159510, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike></td>', '', '2015-04-10 13:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340633, 1146724, 177322, '<td valign="top">By focusing on the intricacies of the wiring technique through the first wooden post, you have avoided a trite fence leading line image; yet, that post does not stop the viewer from traveling down the picture.  Sharp, colorful with lots of interest.  I opened this with the mindset of assigning a seven, but as I worked through my comment I think a nine suites it better.  I hope this does well for you.</td>', 'By focusing on the intricacies of the wiring technique through the first wooden post, you have avoided a trite fence leading line image; yet, that post does not stop the viewer from traveling down the picture.  Sharp, colorful with lots of interest.  I opened this with the mindset of assigning a seven, but as I worked through my comment I think a nine suites it better.  I hope this does well for you.', '2015-04-10 13:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340655, 1147137, 177322, '<td valign="top">Definitely a leading lines but perhaps just a tad too mundane to be striking? Sorry - four.</td>', 'Definitely a leading lines but perhaps just a tad too mundane to be striking? Sorry - four.', '2015-04-10 13:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340748, 1147048, 177322, '<td valign="top">With great interest I opened your submission.  Why with great interest?  Because I, too, had entered not one but two entries of palm lines. After all they are indicative (leading) lines are they not?<br/> <br/>Alas, I withdrew both before the challenged flipped to the voting mode.  The reasons I withdrew both are the same I see in this submission:  self-photographed hands do not seem to show well.  Both shots I prepared for entry made the mounts of my hands look like hams!  I''m sure it was a matter of PoV but it was most unflattering.  Secondly, the coloring - even in B&amp;W and/or with Topaz effects applied - the skin looked cadaverous.  Then, in my circumstance, the partially desaturated one was too soft. While your image is very sharp, unfortunately, it bears similar defects of my abandoned shots:  PoV aberrations and coloring. <br/> <br/>As painful as it is to receive a vote of one, it is more painful to assign a vote of one.  One is what I am voting on this photo.  I hope I have explained sufficiently the reason for this low score and would invite you to contact me after the voting is finished if you wish to plumb my reasoning further.  Sorry.</td>', 'With great interest I opened your submission.  Why with great interest?  Because I, too, had entered not one but two entries of palm lines. After all they are indicative (leading) lines are they not? Alas, I withdrew both before the challenged flipped to the voting mode.  The reasons I withdrew both are the same I see in this submission:  self-photographed hands do not seem to show well.  Both shots I prepared for entry made the mounts of my hands look like hams!  I''m sure it was a matter of PoV but it was most unflattering.  Secondly, the coloring - even in B&W and/or with Topaz effects applied - the skin looked cadaverous.  Then, in my circumstance, the partially desaturated one was too soft. While your image is very sharp, unfortunately, it bears similar defects of my abandoned shots:  PoV aberrations and coloring.  As painful as it is to receive a vote of one, it is more painful to assign a vote of one.  One is what I am voting on this photo.  I hope I have explained sufficiently the reason for this low score and would invite you to contact me after the voting is finished if you wish to plumb my reasoning further.  Sorry.', '2015-04-10 18:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340751, 1146470, 137576, '<td valign="top">you got the leading line unlike many in this challenge but there not much interest in the picture to hold my gaze the wierd non depth of field blurring as well isnt nice</td>', 'you got the leading line unlike many in this challenge but there not much interest in the picture to hold my gaze the wierd non depth of field blurring as well isnt nice', '2015-04-10 18:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340758, 1146784, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! Stand alone top pick. 10. Fave.</td>', 'Fabulous! Stand alone top pick. 10. Fave.', '2015-04-10 18:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340759, 1146850, 137576, '<td valign="top">is that the bridge over the crocodile river waiting to get into the kruger national park?</td>', 'is that the bridge over the crocodile river waiting to get into the kruger national park?', '2015-04-10 18:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340781, 1146825, 137576, '<td valign="top">it leads me in, but it doesnt deliver me to anything, i dont like the halo''ing on the left hand rail and the small bird isnt enough interest in the picture. its very bland colour wise and would have suited b/w better and if youd have walked forward another 15'' i think it would have been better for it, showing me the trees and the horizon.</td>', 'it leads me in, but it doesnt deliver me to anything, i dont like the halo''ing on the left hand rail and the small bird isnt enough interest in the picture. its very bland colour wise and would have suited b/w better and if youd have walked forward another 15'' i think it would have been better for it, showing me the trees and the horizon.', '2015-04-10 20:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340828, 1147020, 177322, '<td valign="top">While it is a fairly classic something-jutting-into-the-sea shot, I still am dazzled by the green sea and darkly brooding sky.  Five</td>', 'While it is a fairly classic something-jutting-into-the-sea shot, I still am dazzled by the green sea and darkly brooding sky.  Five', '2015-04-10 23:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340831, 1146338, 177322, '<td valign="top">The strong lines on the ground are effect but, for me, the busyness of the roof structure is very distracting.  Perhaps a lower PoV would have minimized the impact of the roof?  Four from me.</td>', 'The strong lines on the ground are effect but, for me, the busyness of the roof structure is very distracting.  Perhaps a lower PoV would have minimized the impact of the roof?  Four from me.', '2015-04-10 23:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340833, 1147136, 177322, '<td valign="top">Over sharpened for my personal taste, and I''m not feeling a strong line.  Perhaps a color version would have helped define the walkway and make the plants near the mouth of the tunnel seem less invasive? Four from me. Looks like a lovely place though.</td>', 'Over sharpened for my personal taste, and I''m not feeling a strong line.  Perhaps a color version would have helped define the walkway and make the plants near the mouth of the tunnel seem less invasive? Four from me. Looks like a lovely place though.', '2015-04-10 23:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340834, 1146883, 177322, '<td valign="top">For me, too many crisscrossing lines and, compositionally, while well balanced, there is a sense that too much is crammed into this image.  Perhaps if just the wind turbines or just the electrical high lines had been the subject, it might be a more successful shot. Sorry, but a three from me.  Like the electric sky, though - the B&amp;W conversion gives a very shocking feel - apropos with the subject material.</td>', 'For me, too many crisscrossing lines and, compositionally, while well balanced, there is a sense that too much is crammed into this image.  Perhaps if just the wind turbines or just the electrical high lines had been the subject, it might be a more successful shot. Sorry, but a three from me.  Like the electric sky, though - the B&W conversion gives a very shocking feel - apropos with the subject material.', '2015-04-10 23:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340836, 1147015, 177322, '<td valign="top">The grid of light squares is appealing.  The overall texture feels too granular for my personal taste. The beams are imposing and  arrest the eye from going further into the infinity sight line.  Three.  My apologies, I don''t know what to say about improving the composition of this because the structure looks tight in its bulky sturdiness which probably hinders approaching this from a different angle.</td>', 'The grid of light squares is appealing.  The overall texture feels too granular for my personal taste. The beams are imposing and  arrest the eye from going further into the infinity sight line.  Three.  My apologies, I don''t know what to say about improving the composition of this because the structure looks tight in its bulky sturdiness which probably hinders approaching this from a different angle.', '2015-04-10 23:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340837, 1146244, 177322, '<td valign="top">I think this is water and dirty snow on asphalt?  The leading line points the viewer towards something that is rather nondescript and unattractive. The debris on the ground - over which you have no control - trashes (pun intended) the intent of the leading line by drawing the eye to the right of the image.  One from me.  To improve this concept, I would suggest selecting a line leading to something more attractive - even if it is something you stage - and to make sure there is no detritus to distract from that line.</td>', 'I think this is water and dirty snow on asphalt?  The leading line points the viewer towards something that is rather nondescript and unattractive. The debris on the ground - over which you have no control - trashes (pun intended) the intent of the leading line by drawing the eye to the right of the image.  One from me.  To improve this concept, I would suggest selecting a line leading to something more attractive - even if it is something you stage - and to make sure there is no detritus to distract from that line.', '2015-04-10 23:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340840, 1147023, 177322, '<td valign="top">For me, this is too discordant:  no direct leading line(s), the cracked plaster wall acts as barrier to the eye; the fellow on the left appears distorted.  The girls, however seem to be having fun!   Sorry, two.</td>', 'For me, this is too discordant:  no direct leading line(s), the cracked plaster wall acts as barrier to the eye; the fellow on the left appears distorted.  The girls, however seem to be having fun!   Sorry, two.', '2015-04-10 23:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340841, 1147134, 177322, '<td valign="top">Color seems to be a good choice here.  And, the focus is clearly on the crack across the double yellow line.  I''m not sure there is much interest here, though.  Sorry, three.</td>', 'Color seems to be a good choice here.  And, the focus is clearly on the crack across the double yellow line.  I''m not sure there is much interest here, though.  Sorry, three.', '2015-04-10 23:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340853, 1147128, 177322, '<td valign="top">This setting looks dreamy and calm. Has an Orton Effect been applied or have those endorphins kicked in by now and you''ve managed to captured that sedating haze via the camera lens?  I like the anchor of the colorful riders in the front, yet the main leading line (the road) is supported secondarily by the trickling of riders - both carry on purposefully to the horizon.  Six.</td>', 'This setting looks dreamy and calm. Has an Orton Effect been applied or have those endorphins kicked in by now and you''ve managed to captured that sedating haze via the camera lens?  I like the anchor of the colorful riders in the front, yet the main leading line (the road) is supported secondarily by the trickling of riders - both carry on purposefully to the horizon.  Six.', '2015-04-11 00:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340854, 1147102, 177322, '<td valign="top">What intriguing places, but I''m just not sure about the effect applied.  For me personally, the image is visually jangling with the shards of light and the tangle of grass.  Sorry, a two from me.  However, the signs seem to have lots of texture and might be worth revisiting to explore that aspect.</td>', 'What intriguing places, but I''m just not sure about the effect applied.  For me personally, the image is visually jangling with the shards of light and the tangle of grass.  Sorry, a two from me.  However, the signs seem to have lots of texture and might be worth revisiting to explore that aspect.', '2015-04-11 00:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340855, 1147066, 177322, '<td valign="top">This image captures the brawniness of what appears to be a structure intended to be a light and airy experience from a user''s perspective.  Creative PoV and good clarity.  <strike>Six</strike>. Bump to seven.</td>', 'This image captures the brawniness of what appears to be a structure intended to be a light and airy experience from a user''s perspective.  Creative PoV and good clarity.  Six. Bump to seven.', '2015-04-11 00:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340859, 1147120, 177322, '<td valign="top">Delightful title.  I applaud the dual leading lines of the spider web and the fencing.  The bokeh perfectly isolates both of those lines. Lovely golden green coloring.  <strike>Nine</strike>. Ten.</td>', 'Delightful title.  I applaud the dual leading lines of the spider web and the fencing.  The bokeh perfectly isolates both of those lines. Lovely golden green coloring.  Nine. Ten.', '2015-04-11 00:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341055, 1146784, 42495, '<td valign="top">Best of the challenge.  Congrats.</td>', 'Best of the challenge.  Congrats.', '2015-04-11 13:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341061, 1147048, 42495, '<td valign="top">Kind of interesting, but the lines aren''t leading anywhere.</td>', 'Kind of interesting, but the lines aren''t leading anywhere.', '2015-04-11 14:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341064, 1146481, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good leading lines, but the horizon looks slanted to me.</td>', 'Good leading lines, but the horizon looks slanted to me.', '2015-04-11 14:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341067, 1146706, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but kind of a stretch for the challenge.</td>', 'I like the photo, but kind of a stretch for the challenge.', '2015-04-11 14:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341169, 1147068, 177322, '<td valign="top">The bridge rails add a nice secondary line, and I like that the red shirt pulls the viewer''s eye further through the image. Five.</td>', 'The bridge rails add a nice secondary line, and I like that the red shirt pulls the viewer''s eye further through the image. Five.', '2015-04-11 16:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341171, 1146351, 177322, '<td valign="top">Not sure that I see any leading lines, implied or direct, but the texture is fabulous!  Four.  Clever title, btw.</td>', 'Not sure that I see any leading lines, implied or direct, but the texture is fabulous!  Four.  Clever title, btw.', '2015-04-11 16:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341175, 1147009, 177322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Five.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Five.', '2015-04-11 16:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341178, 1146986, 177322, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I just don''t see the leading lines and the model exhaling cigarette smoke is unflattering.  Technically, a good sharp shot well exposed.  But because the link to the challenge seems weak, to me personally, a four.  Sorry, again.</td>', 'Sorry but I just don''t see the leading lines and the model exhaling cigarette smoke is unflattering.  Technically, a good sharp shot well exposed.  But because the link to the challenge seems weak, to me personally, a four.  Sorry, again.', '2015-04-11 16:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341183, 1147103, 177322, '<td valign="top">I''m perplexed how this fits the challenge - the line of photographers?</td>', 'I''m perplexed how this fits the challenge - the line of photographers?', '2015-04-11 16:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341261, 1147112, 128323, '<td valign="top">I think you''re going to get dinged for these lines not necessarily being ''leading''.  The lines kind of point from left to right, when your subject (the boy) is all the way to the left.  Still, a good composition as a photo.</td>', 'I think you''re going to get dinged for these lines not necessarily being ''leading''.  The lines kind of point from left to right, when your subject (the boy) is all the way to the left.  Still, a good composition as a photo.', '2015-04-11 19:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341262, 1147089, 128323, '<td valign="top">The reflections off of the dashboard are a bit distracting.</td>', 'The reflections off of the dashboard are a bit distracting.', '2015-04-11 19:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341263, 1146402, 128323, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Love the misshapen heart :)</td>', 'Great photo.  Love the misshapen heart :)', '2015-04-11 19:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341264, 1146446, 128323, '<td valign="top">Great subject, seems a bit oversharpened though.  Would love to know where (and what) this is.</td>', 'Great subject, seems a bit oversharpened though.  Would love to know where (and what) this is.', '2015-04-11 19:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341265, 1146961, 128323, '<td valign="top">Looks like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=123833" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">marnet</a>photo.  Very nice.  Too bad the right-side lamps are out along the walk.</td>', 'Looks like a  marnetphoto.  Very nice.  Too bad the right-side lamps are out along the walk.', '2015-04-11 20:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341266, 1146470, 128323, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines, but way over-processed for my taste.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines, but way over-processed for my taste.', '2015-04-11 20:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341267, 1147103, 128323, '<td valign="top">Intriguing.</td>', 'Intriguing.', '2015-04-11 20:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341269, 1146481, 128323, '<td valign="top">This would do much better I think if you brightened the foreground of the bridge.  Good perspective and leading lines.</td>', 'This would do much better I think if you brightened the foreground of the bridge.  Good perspective and leading lines.', '2015-04-11 20:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341270, 1147048, 128323, '<td valign="top">Very creative take on the challenge... well done :)</td>', 'Very creative take on the challenge... well done :)', '2015-04-11 20:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341271, 1146959, 128323, '<td valign="top">Love the tones here.</td>', 'Love the tones here.', '2015-04-11 20:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341272, 1146399, 128323, '<td valign="top">Looks like an <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=109387" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Alexkc</a>to me.. Very nice, dude!</td>', 'Looks like an  Alexkcto me.. Very nice, dude!', '2015-04-11 20:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341273, 1146798, 128323, '<td valign="top">blurry foregrounds are kind of tough for leading lines.  It makes me look more at the blur than what it actually leads to.</td>', 'blurry foregrounds are kind of tough for leading lines.  It makes me look more at the blur than what it actually leads to.', '2015-04-11 20:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341274, 1147070, 128323, '<td valign="top">What a shot! My pick for blue.  Well done.</td>', 'What a shot! My pick for blue.  Well done.', '2015-04-11 20:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341275, 1146909, 128323, '<td valign="top">Beautiful painting of light on the boardwalk.  Love this.</td>', 'Beautiful painting of light on the boardwalk.  Love this.', '2015-04-11 20:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341277, 1147058, 128323, '<td valign="top">What a colorful city!</td>', 'What a colorful city!', '2015-04-11 20:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341278, 1147118, 128323, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait till this challenge is over, hope you tell is what this actually is!  Very interesting photo.</td>', 'Can''t wait till this challenge is over, hope you tell is what this actually is!  Very interesting photo.', '2015-04-11 20:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341280, 1146825, 128323, '<td valign="top">Too much processing involved here.  The road is blurry, there''s banding in the sky, artifacts around the edges of the bridge.  It fits for ''leading lines'', but the first thing I see is processing, not the photo.</td>', 'Too much processing involved here.  The road is blurry, there''s banding in the sky, artifacts around the edges of the bridge.  It fits for ''leading lines'', but the first thing I see is processing, not the photo.', '2015-04-11 20:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341283, 1146338, 128323, '<td valign="top">I''m always trying to guess <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=19825" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">markwiley</a>''s photos--this one is my guess.  Either way, nice perspective, location, and use of black and white.</td>', 'I''m always trying to guess  markwiley''s photos--this one is my guess.  Either way, nice perspective, location, and use of black and white.', '2015-04-11 20:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341353, 1147116, 177322, '<td valign="top">There is a tree on my land that is repeatedly struck by lightening - better that than my roof, I guess.  Anyway, it appears as those these two have suffered multiple weather events in their lives and are about to endure another. The subtlety of the leading line defines this image.  <strike>Five</strike> from me.  Bump to six after further reflection.  Wishing you good fortune with this image.</td>', 'There is a tree on my land that is repeatedly struck by lightening - better that than my roof, I guess.  Anyway, it appears as those these two have suffered multiple weather events in their lives and are about to endure another. The subtlety of the leading line defines this image.  Five from me.  Bump to six after further reflection.  Wishing you good fortune with this image.', '2015-04-11 23:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
