(7341539, 1146836, 177322, '<td valign="top">Glossy.  Nice tonal range.  Strong lines.  The reflection in the glass of that structure to the right is moderately distracting.  Still, eight.</td>', 'Glossy.  Nice tonal range.  Strong lines.  The reflection in the glass of that structure to the right is moderately distracting.  Still, eight.', '2015-04-12 11:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
