(7341607, 1146798, 96751, '<td valign="top">Finally, a leading line with reward at the end of it!  On the other hand, half the image (and the "line") is blurry and quite uninteresting...</td>', 'Finally, a leading line with reward at the end of it!  On the other hand, half the image (and the "line") is blurry and quite uninteresting...', '2015-04-12 14:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341608, 1146961, 96751, '<td valign="top">Based on location and pp''g, I''m going to guess this is Margaret''s entry. If not, take that as a compliment.<br/> <br/>This is a beautiful location for sure, with lovely light and glow. But it suffers from what so many entries in this challenge do, the lines lead to nothing. For me, "leading lines" is only half the equation. They must lead somewhere or to something at the end of them, to reward the viewer. In the case of this image, there seems to be a small arch, which is mostly in the dark. That is not rewarding enough for me. A couple kissing. A beach ball. A bird landing. A dog walking. Something.</td>', 'Based on location and pp''g, I''m going to guess this is Margaret''s entry. If not, take that as a compliment. This is a beautiful location for sure, with lovely light and glow. But it suffers from what so many entries in this challenge do, the lines lead to nothing. For me, "leading lines" is only half the equation. They must lead somewhere or to something at the end of them, to reward the viewer. In the case of this image, there seems to be a small arch, which is mostly in the dark. That is not rewarding enough for me. A couple kissing. A beach ball. A bird landing. A dog walking. Something.', '2015-04-12 14:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
