(7342866, 1147018, 156466, '<td valign="top">The verticals on the back wall reduce the impact of the leading lines almost to the point where they don''t lead so much any more.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'The verticals on the back wall reduce the impact of the leading lines almost to the point where they don''t lead so much any more.  Nice shot though.', '2015-04-16 10:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
