(7342880, 1147089, 156466, '<td valign="top">I was actually going to criticize the windshield reflection until I realized that removing them would have made this just one more sunset photo I had to look at.  It gives it character to the point that I''m not even bothered by the crooked horizon. I don''t know if that was the plan all along or just serendipity, but it made for a 3 point increase over what I was going to give you. :)</td>', 'I was actually going to criticize the windshield reflection until I realized that removing them would have made this just one more sunset photo I had to look at.  It gives it character to the point that I''m not even bothered by the crooked horizon. I don''t know if that was the plan all along or just serendipity, but it made for a 3 point increase over what I was going to give you. :)', '2015-04-16 10:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
